     "replacement": "1. Find the gradient: $m=\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}$\n2. Substitute $m$ and one of the points into $y-y_1=m(x-x_1)$.\n3. Rearrange to $y=mx+c$.",
